{"id":"vod_md_6079","vodId":"6079","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"白箱","name_cn":"白箱","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"24集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20231020-1/891be5d97f8cf4f2a3d6376004252079.jpg"},"summary":"所谓的“白箱”，是指在动画放送之前，专门制作赠送给参与了动画制作的工作人员们的录像带，其本身拥有着令人感动的悠久历史，因为这些录像带通常都被装在白色的盒子里，所以被成为“白箱”。一直坚守着自己理想的制作人宫森葵（木村珠莉 配音）、个性认真但有些懦弱的原画师安原绘麻（佳 村遥 配音）、怀才不遇的声优坂木静香（千菅春香 配音）、CG画师藤堂美沙（高野麻美 配音）和容易沉迷与自身兴趣爱好的剧本作家今井绿（大和田仁美 配音），五个个性迥异的女孩，朝着顺利完成白箱的梦想共同努力迈进，在这条并不轻松的道路上，会发生哪些有趣的故事呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-10-20 07:23:57","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231017/gLwgRg1G/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231017/FnVIkZQX/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231017/1ZHFNQuY/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231017/6HyjLeVs/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231017/JVW7IeMK/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231017/walH2y5S/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231017/G1zYdqDX/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231017/eADFk4th/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231017/uaC2FHzJ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231017/jusbQWlz/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231017/nVjexMUR/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231017/7Q9YRRlY/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231017/QcBPQg6e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231017/FEFT4Xnz/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231017/NEtXCdbO/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://play.mod